    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp local-id=\"5a47e8bd422e\"\u003eThe primary objective of this system is to ensure the correct conclusion of the billing process. The billing procedure will take into consideration data derived from contracts and orders. Consequently, both of these components are essential for the correct execution of the process. To create a contract or an order, it is mandatory to define its parameters in accordance with the product, service, and goods objects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"9455ae0aad43\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0a4ae2ab3621\"\u003eThe process of creating interim and advance payments within Bundle 2 follows a structure that involves the collection of essential information to accurately define the contract\u0027s parameters through products and services. The primary objective of interim and advance payments is to provide customers with the option to make define upfront payments for products or services as part of the contract.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c0c24b9eb0be\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6f8a2971ce55\"\u003eInterim and advance payment object contains one individual tab, where it is mandatory to specify its parameters to facilitate the correct creation of contracts. These parameters include:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"8e2758d440e1\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"fe15513da381\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"cdee753e0eae\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eName:\u003c/strong\u003e this field is mandatory and defines information related to the interim and advance payments.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"74aecd2ce9ea\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6be58c5afa3e\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eValue type:\u003c/strong\u003e this parameter enables users to select the calculation logic type. Options include defining a percentage based on the previous invoice amount, specifying an exact payment amount, or calculating the amount based on the chosen price component. Users can also define the value and its range, with the mandatory inclusion of the currency for the specified amount.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"2f51b1999701\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"d3074ce0da2a\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d9b390c3d027\"\u003eIf the obligatory checkbox is selected, it signifies that in contracts containing this interim and advance payment, it is mandatory to pay the defined amount.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"3f9844dd4cf9\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"817a552e728d\"\u003eIf at least one checkbox is selected, it indicates that when a contract includes multiple interim and advance payments, at least one of the must be chosen to accurately calculate the customer\u0027s total liability with the billing process.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"2700359f69d4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"22c0b8142f98\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDate of issue:\u003c/strong\u003e it is mandatory to define when the interim and advance payment should be made within the contract for the selected customer. If the \u0027date of the month\u0027 option is chosen, the system allows for the definition of a time period or a total value if necessary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"7fbdffdcdd1e\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"048db2895d38\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice component:\u003c/strong\u003e when the \u0027value type\u0027 is defined as the \u0027price component\u0027 option, user can select a relevant price component on the interim and advance payment page. The system displayed only those price components that have not been associated with other objects in the system and available for selection.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"60d04aabc8e3\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"09f0e88189bb\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePeriodicity:\u003c/strong\u003e this feature allows users to specify exact weeks or months when the interim and advance payment should be active. Alternatively, user can choose a yearly time period, in which case the system recognizes that the interim and advance payment should remain active for a one-year interval.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"16d9ee873519\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4885d6ef0354\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIssuing\u0026nbsp; for the month to the current:\u003c/strong\u003e through this field it is possible to define when to get the an interim and advance payment. For example, if user should get an interim and advance payment in September and selects +1 option, it means that it will be calculated in October.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"2d6acd01f343\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d6239fc2854c\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDeduction from:\u003c/strong\u003e it is mandatory to define from which invoice should this interim and advance payment\u0027s amount be deducted\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"1a1e7809517d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4c74c42e69fc\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment term:\u003c/strong\u003e it is mandatory to define payment term values within the interim and advance payment object. Payment terms sub-object aims to outline the time range or period for the payment process of the contract. User can also select the logic for calculation this time period, such as working days or calendar days.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"dffad00236bd\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ce9026fc7df5\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"55b8bae963f5\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMatched with the term of the standard invoice:\u003c/strong\u003e if this checkbox is selected, it means that defining a separate payment term for the interim and advance payment is not possible. The payment process of the created object should align with the terms of the standard invoice for this interim and advance payment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4c0db59ad566\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"564c97e42f07\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo interest on overdue debts:\u003c/strong\u003e this checkbox allows users to specify that for contracts with this term, no interest should be accrued on overdue debts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c614345a7438\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eMinimal amount for interim payment\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d72d2385e43d\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eAfter the full interim invoice amount is calculated (including VAT, in default currency, per existing rounding rules), the system compares the Total amount including VAT to the minimal interim payment threshold of 5 EUR.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"8605ef18-1065-4403-be78-6d418453457a\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"3112d765-2c5d-4d2b-bb2c-cbb22a409278\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"450f94591ad9\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eIf Total amount including VAT is greater than or equal to 5 EUR, the system creates the interim invoice and related liabilities as today.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4edc4eed-432d-4029-9f0e-4412ac27a1c4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e4bacc6ca356\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eIf Total amount including VAT is less than 5 EUR, the system does not create the interim invoice.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"757ed9d4d2e4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eThis rule applies to all interim payments, including invoices generated by the billing-run interim pipeline and by Manual interim and advance payment billing runs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"69cf87844be2\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"fb2ac971cf6f\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDuring interim and advance payment creation:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"ea9ea2bbd0ab\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"707988cadf6d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"3623b59dad7e\"\u003eWhen creating an interim and advance payment, completion of all required fields is mandatory.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"e294b3004fc7\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4d45bad9cc3b\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"0515e99aaba9\"\u003eAfter clicking the \u0027Create\u0027 button, the system should check frontend validation, and if an error is detected, it should be displayed in the proper field.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"be9ac7a8ffe3\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"9962c91c2243\"\u003eIn the event of a backend error (after successful frontend validation), the system also displays an error message.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"42b1206f1f56\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"62b7bab93b82\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"bb0fa4a52c03\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDuring interim and advance payment editing:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"fc8b9972cdfe\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"96d933b24549\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1c8a2766be2d\"\u003eInterim and advance payment does not include versioning functionality and only one version of the interim and advance payment should be created.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ffcdd3056022\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"75ef6127e8b6\"\u003eIf an interim and advance payment is already included in a contract or order, editing without \u0027Edit Locked\u0027 permission is not possible.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5c266c465283\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"93c5b2dc3e63\"\u003eIt is possible to change all the fields parameters in the editing mode.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5da34176df1d\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"7b9272f6be8a\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eCopy functionality:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"5cb9e46ab493\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b120c0870748\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"262af1e503ad\"\u003eThe interim and advance payment includes a copy functionality, accessible during both the creation and editing modes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"f1825ad83c7d\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"0c198f0653bc\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"183cad5350ee\"\u003eDuring the creation and edit mode, it\u0027s possible to select a desired interim and advance payment to create a new object. This allows for the duplication of an object with the ability to modify its parameters. In case of any errors, the system promptly provides error notifications.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"285c38126c55\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c246d265e7ae\"\u003eIf an object contains inactive nomenclature, while coping that object should not be copied.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a3cc5bca0a63\"\u003eCustomer Feedbacks: \u003ca href=\"https://oppa-support.atlassian.net/browse/PDT-2872\" local-id=\"c76e7ba1c2b9\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\"\u003ehttps://oppa-support.atlassian.net/browse/PDT-2872\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e",
